WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:12.637
Now, open wide!

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.810
-Hey!
-Open wide!

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:30.822
Go, don't just eat the meat.
Have some vegetables too.

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:35.827
Oh, my.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:42.667
Tie it like this and it won't come undone.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.669
Welcome back.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:47.130
I'm back.

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:54.179
What a cutie.

00:00:56.514 --> 00:00:57.474
Don't worry.

00:00:58.141 --> 00:00:59.893
We'll figure something out.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.228
Don't hurt my family!

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.360
I care for Sara very much, too.
I wish to protect Sara.

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:12.906
Retsuko!

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:17.160
You're such a good girl, Retsuko.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.454
You're still my son!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.956
Ride! With all the speed you can muster!

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.375
Show them you're a man!

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:34.094
Hurry, hurry!

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:48.525
"I will always be your mother."

00:01:49.651 --> 00:01:50.443
Mom...

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:54.030
Don't give up. We're here with you.

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:59.202
"You are so very darling to me."

